  abilityDesc: 26 combo Earth attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    spark damage fills BB gauge for 3 turns, boosts all elemental damage for 3 turns,
    3 turns DoT infliction, may raise allies from KO & probable all status ailments
    infliction
